  "caption": "You hate writing emails, and AI never sounds like you.\n\nThe fix is context. AI needs to know you to do things the way you would. Our second brain keeps a folder on each person, sorted by what they're good at, what they've talked about, and the years of their life, so the AI pulls from the real you.\n\nAn AI system that writes like you is just good context in organized folders, so it handles your emails and posts instead of hiring an employee to do it.\n\nFollow for AI systems instead of hiring an employee.",
