  "caption": "Build a Jarvis for your life.\n\nYour calendar is full, but the little things are still floating around in your head.\n\nStart with one note: your fixed commitments, the errands you need to do and what is still missing. Ask the assistant to turn it into a plan and flag the clashes.\n\nThis is a starter you can try in a chat you already use. Save your preferences in your own note and paste them into a new conversation when needed.\n\nThe recorded demo uses a fictional day and real AI output. It has no live calendar access, reminders or memory between runs. Nothing is booked or sent.\n\nI build custom AI systems for busy business owners who want help with repeat admin before deciding whether they need to hire.\n\nComment JARVIS and I\u2019ll send you the starter setup.",
